{
    "title": "Juds- Random Live Video Chat",
    "description": "Welcome to Juds! A live random video chatting app to meet strangers and chat with friends. Thousands of users are waiting to be discovered, just a tap away! \r\n\r\nWith Juds, you can live chat with new people from over 100 countries via endless video chats, auto-translated messaging and voice calls. Juds lets you turn random strangers into close friends one video chat at a time.\r\n\r\nSimple and straightforward live social app features:\r\n\r\n\u2728A single tap is all you need to start live random video chatting with random people. \r\nYou can use the location and gender filter feature to save valuable time and let Juds do the work by filtering your preferences while you live video chat with your connections.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0eLive video chats and calls just got a whole lot simpler with the automatic translation feature. With Juds, you can interact with people from different cultures and backgrounds without worrying about language barriers through live auto-translated messaging.\r\n\r\n\u2795Follow your closest friends to get notified when they go online and chat. No need to waste any time scouring through users to live video chat. However, if you\u2019re feeling lucky you can test your luck by live random video chatting with strangers anywhere, anytime. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5Either way, rest assured that Juds provides private and secure video chat and messaging. User privacy is a top priority for the Juds team, and live video chats are protected by various safety features to maintain a safe environment for all users. \r\n\r\nAll live video chats start with a blurring filter and your location is never fully revealed. One-on-one video chats are private and inaccessible by other users. \r\nProviding a secure user experience is very important. Therefore, in order for the Juds team to take necessary actions, please respect our guidelines and report any users that behave inappropriately. \r\n\r\nJuds offers optional in-app purchases for premium features that provide you more control over who you meet and chat with.\r\n\r\nDownload Juds now to discover new users and join in on the fun!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Juds Team\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t hesitate to reach out to our team for any inquiries.\r\nContact us at helpdesk@judsapp.com\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://judsapp.com/pp/\r\nTerms of Service: https://judsapp.com/tos/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Juds! A live random video chatting app to meet strangers and chat with friends. Thousands of users are waiting to be discovered, just a tap away! <br><br>With Juds, you can live chat with new people from over 100 countries via endless video chats, auto-translated messaging and voice calls. Juds lets you turn random strangers into close friends one video chat at a time.<br><br>Simple and straightforward live social app features:<br><br>\u2728A single tap is all you need to start live random video chatting with random people. <br>You can use the location and gender filter feature to save valuable time and let Juds do the work by filtering your preferences while you live video chat with your connections.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0eLive video chats and calls just got a whole lot simpler with the automatic translation feature. With Juds, you can interact with people from different cultures and backgrounds without worrying about language barriers through live auto-translated messaging.<br><br>\u2795Follow your closest friends to get notified when they go online and chat. No need to waste any time scouring through users to live video chat. However, if you\u2019re feeling lucky you can test your luck by live random video chatting with strangers anywhere, anytime. <br><br>\ud83d\udca5Either way, rest assured that Juds provides private and secure video chat and messaging. User privacy is a top priority for the Juds team, and live video chats are protected by various safety features to maintain a safe environment for all users. <br><br>All live video chats start with a blurring filter and your location is never fully revealed. One-on-one video chats are private and inaccessible by other users. <br>Providing a secure user experience is very important. Therefore, in order for the Juds team to take necessary actions, please respect our guidelines and report any users that behave inappropriately. <br><br>Juds offers optional in-app purchases for premium 